          "fields": {
            "display_title": "This paper introduces a novel meta-learning framework with the attention-on-label mechanism for efficient learning from multiple sets of noisy annotators. The proposed network can learn, from both the image and its associated text, to predict the class membership through a weighted summation of individual noisy annotators. Comparisons with different methods on several datasets show that the proposed framework can lead to improvement in predictive accuracy.",
